		{"id":"88b7ad247fc29273","type":"file","file":"Session Canvases/Session 34, Nefanda/Images/Pasted image 20260915170558.png","x":-458,"y":-60,"width":333,"height":810},
		{"id":"8b28ba2552db0104","type":"text","text":"Loot on Gabriel: \n\nWinged Boots\n\nScroll of Slow\n\n3000gp\n\nInstructions on where to find a Ziggurat in Wildfort. \n\nAnd Cabals ruin the Vestige of Moradin \n\nThe Instructions read, In a very very ancient form of Abyssal and are enchanted so that you cannot use comprehend Languages on them\n\n\nᚵᛆᛒᚱᛁᛂᛚ,\n\nᚤᚮᚢ ᚡᛁᛚᛚ ᚠᛁᚿᛑ Þᛂ Zᛁᚵᚵᚢᚱᛆᛐ ᛁᚿ ᚡᛁᛚᛑ ᚠᚮᚱᛐ ᚢᚿᛑᛂᚱᚿᛆÞ Þᛂ ᛚᚢᛉᛁᛂᚱᛂ ᛂᛍᛐᛆᛐᛂ. ᛐᛡᛂᚱᛂ ᛁᛍ ᛆᚿ ᛆᚿᛌᛁᛂᚿᛐ ᛔᛆᛍᛍᛆᚵᛂ ᚡᛆᚤ ᛁᚿ Þᛂ ᛌᚱᚤᛔᛐ ᛒᛂᛡᛁᚿᛑ ᛆ ᛔᛆᛁᚿᛐᛁᛜ ᚮᚠ ᛉᛅᛚᛚᛂ ᛚᚢᛉᛁᛂᚱᛂ, ᚡᛡᛂᚿ ᚤᚮᚢ ᚵᚮᛐ Þᛂᚱᛂ ᛍᛔᛆᚴ Þᛂ ᚡᚮᚱᛑᛍ, ᛁ ᚡᛁᛚᛚ ᚴᛂᛂᛔ ᚤᚮᚢᚱ ᛍᛂᛌᚱᛂᛐ ᚢᚿᛑᚤᛁᛜ ᚮᚿᛂ. ᚠᛆᛁᛚ ᛉᛂ ᛆᚿᛑ ᛁ ᚡᛁᛚᛚ ᛉᛆᚴᛂ ᚤᚮᚢᚱ ᛑᛆᚢᚵᛡᛐᛂᚱ ᛉᚤ Þᚱᛆᛚᛚ.\n\nᛁᚿ ᛡᛁᛍ ᚱᛂᛐᚢᚱᚿ,\n\nᚡᛂᚱᛆZᛆᚿᚮÞ\n\nGabriel,\n\nYou will find the Ziggurat in Wild fort underneath the Lumiere estate. There is an ancient passage way in the crypt behind a painting of Maelle Lumiere, when you get there speak the words, I will keep your secret Undying One. Fail me and I will make your daughter my thrall.\n\n","x":-60,"y":-20,"width":825,"height":670},
		{"id":"d7b0f08620744d55","x":-60,"y":700,"width":1854,"height":760,"type":"file","file":"Session Canvases/Session 34, Nefanda/Images/Pasted image 20260915170621.png"}
